(b) the time taken to issue an NOC for the construction of rural roads in these areas;
(c) the number of NOC requests pending for the construction of rural roads at present; and
(d) the details of steps taken by Government to issue certificates expeditiously?

(a) whether a plan has been formulated by Government to accord priority for promoting trade and investment with 12 countries;
(b) whether any plan has been formulated for boosting trade and investment in respect of every country in specific fields; and
(c) the plan for promotion especially of engineering exports to such countries?

(a) whether it is a fact that a large number of technically educated youth from eastern Uttar Pradesh migrate for employment in the software industry;
(b) whether Government is doing infrastructural development work in this field on large scale and planning to set up and develop a Software Technology Park in eastern Uttar Pradesh, keeping in mind the interests of the youth of the region; and
(c) if so, the details thereof?

(a) whether it is a fact that the National Career Service is an initiative of Government which is creating jobs by bringing job seekers and employers of various sectors on a platform;
(b) if so, whether as per its State Integration Status Report of June 2022, the integration of nine States is pending;
(c) the main reasons for the pendency of the integration of these nine States into the National Career Service initiative until now; and
(d) the details, if any, of the ratio of rural youth among the users of this platform?
